<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Pavón</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1861">1861</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/argentine-civil-wars">Argentine Civil Wars</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Pavón was fought on 17 September 1861 in Santa Fe province between the forces of the State of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/buenos-aires">Buenos Aires</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bartolome-mitre">Bartolomé Mitre</a> and those of the Argentine Confederation under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/justo-jose-de-urquiza">Justo José de Urquiza</a>. Urquiza withdrew from the field despite an uncertain outcome, leaving Mitre the victor. The battle led to national reunification under Buenos Aires leadership, with Mitre elected president in 1862.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-pavon.jpg" alt="Battle of Pavón" width="320" height="205" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Ignacio Manzoni · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Batalla_de_Pavon.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
